! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! Proposed Definition of ''xo''
;__xo__: question word to which the answer is a number
!! Examples of ''xo'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''ci'i''
;__ci'i__: infinity; when followed by a number, denotes a transfinite cardinal, such as ℵ{SUB()}0{SUB}. As multiplication and exponentiation of transfinite ordinals is incompatible with that of cardinals, a new cmavo should be added for a transfinite ordinal, such as ω{SUB()}0{SUB}.
!! Examples of ''ci'i'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''ka'o''
;__ka'o__: i, imaginary unit. When followed by a real number, multiplies that number by i. If four real numbers are separated by three ''ka'o'', the number is a quaternion, with the components in the order 1, i, j, k.
!! Examples of ''ka'o'' Usage
saclu fi'ure loi lujna'u li paka'opa .iku'i saclu piro loi lujna'u li ni'upaka'opa
''Only half the complex numbers can be represented in base 1+i, but all complex numbers can be represented in base i-1.''
!! Proposed Definition of ''pai''
;__pai__: pi, circumference divided by diameter
!! Examples of ''pai'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''te'o''
;__te'o__: e, Euler's number
!! Examples of ''te'o'' Usage
''li te'o te'a ka'o bi'e pi'i pai su'i pa du li no''
!! Proposed Definition of ''tu'o''
;__tu'o__: null operand; inspecific number or placeholder digit
!! Examples of ''tu'o'' Usage